@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54331/functions/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Payment history with default limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Payment history with custom limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/payments?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/payments?limit=51
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
